    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522">

                <pb facs="0954" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.01/427</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Presidents Special Assistant</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hopkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>-, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-12-20">December 20, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Cordell</hi>: Here is a memo which Eden handed me in confidence in Cairo, which apparently was
                    prepared for Eden by some of his
                    associates prior to his talk with the King of Greece.</p>
                <p>Mr. Eden told me that he followed this line
                    of argument with the King and I gather he made it pretty strong.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d522-f1"/></p>
                <p>Cordially yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry L.
                                Hopkins</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d522-a1.xml" xpointer="d522-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
